WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
[Upbeat instrumental music]

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
The Sessions grid shows three sample agent panes.

00:03.000 --> 00:06.000
Open Codex to read the full pane.

00:06.000 --> 00:10.500
Expand the drawer to reach the session controls.

00:10.500 --> 00:15.500
Write a follow-up draft. This demo does not send it.

00:15.500 --> 00:21.000
Switch between Claude and OpenCode using the tabs.

00:21.000 --> 00:25.600
Open the attention inbox to check which sessions need review.


00:00:25.567 --> 00:00:31.067
Three real Herdr terminal jobs run together: tests, a build, and a local server.


00:00:31.067 --> 00:00:38.149
Open each pane to see its live output.


00:00:38.149 --> 00:00:47.974
Switch themes: Ghostty, Matrix, Windows XP, and iMessage light.


00:00:47.974 --> 00:00:55.116
QuotaDeck shows a real, approved usage snapshot. Cached readings are labeled.
